sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VM as ProfileViewModel
    participant SM as SessionManager
    participant Stores as Session-scoped stores
    participant Srv as Backend

    User->>VM: tap Log out
    VM->>SM: logout(allDevices=false)
    SM->>Srv: POST /logout (revoke this session)
    SM->>Stores: clearForLogout() for each
    SM->>SM: wipe tokens/keys (Ch 20)
    SM-->>SM: emit SessionState.Unauthenticated
    Note over SM: nav root swaps to Login, ViewModels gone with the graph
